<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">- Lamma</book>
  <para style="h1">Afisawayi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Bulus Sẽkoo yɛnɛ Shɔ AFISAWAYI</para>
  <para style="toc2">Afisawayi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Afis</para>
  <para style="mt2">Bulus Sẽkoo yɛnɛ shɔ</para>
  <para style="mt1">AFISAWAYI</para>
  <para style="imt1">Yutasinɛ</para>
  <para style="ip">
    <char style="bk">Bulus Sẽkoo yɛnɛ Afisawayi </char>Nwanya aru &lt;&lt;Ɗalapa vigbete mayɛ, u n ti vigbete shɛshiyɛ aɗɔ zɔ kpai, vigbete a kolapa a kotipini kpai, Kirisikɔ yupɛ̃ni.&gt;&gt; (1.10). Shɔ gaki Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi nɛi yaa vigbete pẽnɛba a Ɗalapa mayɛ aru i toli shɔzɛ yuu i ɔ̃ a nyazɔ a nyaba ɔ̃nɛ a Yesɔ Kirisini.</para>
  <para style="ip">A vigbete shɔ gaa beenɛ a Afisawayi Shɔ vi beenɛu bee vi a ã kaka ba aru yuu ɓasinɛ, a nyaba gbete Ɗalapa ɓeye lɔɔ ɓɛshɔzɛyɛ, a nɔgbete shɔ yaasiyi ruuvini ai kpaa naraanɛ a Yesɔ Kirisi Ɗajaa kabii, a vi pẽnɛba gbete Ɗalapa mayɛ a Ɗa Suru ãyɛ nyamasinɛ ɓa. A vigbete Bulus pɛsi Afisawayi beerinɛ, a gaki shɔ viɓalinɛi nɛ i ɔ̃ a nyaba gbete i ɔ̃nɛ a nyazɔ a Kirisi a kabii u nizɛ ai ɔ̃nɛni.</para>
  <para style="ip">Shɔ shovi a ruuɓusinɛ tot-tot aru u tasi shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi nɛi a nyazɔ a yuu ɓasinɛ a Kirisini: wɛrɛ Ɗa naa bi, a Kirisini nɛ ukɔ yupɛ̃ni; ko naa ɗɔ gbete shɔ mayɛ, a Kirisi kɛ naa tari gbete shɔ pɔ̃ a ɗɔɔ wanɛ; ko naa suwɛrɛ, Kirisi naa ɓɛvɔɔ. Sẽkɔm yɛ kpɛlɛ-kpɛlɛ au nyanwani nagbete shɔvi beenɛu Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ gɨn awuni a Kirisi kabii. Shɔ zɛ Ko-iviyatɔ sẽsẽ a Kirisi ɔrinɛni, yuu ãnɛ, ruuvini yaasinɛ, Ɗa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ, a sɔkinɛni.</para>
  <para style="iot">Vi au Ɓuzɨn yɛ</para>
  <para style="io1">Yutasinɛ (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Kirisi a shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi (1.3-3.21)</para>
  <para style="io1">Suru a Kirisi (4.1-6.20)</para>
  <para style="io1">Yisinɛ (6.21-24)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="s1">Nyageenɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Sẽkoom shɛ a Bulus ɗɔbii, a Ɗalapa kasinɛni ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Kirisi Yesɔ jashonɛ</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:1">Yɛnɛ Ɗalapa shɔ biyi a Afisa, shɔgbeteyi vi pɛlinɛ tɔ̃vɨn ai ɔ̃nɛni a yuu ɓasinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔni:<verse eid="EPH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Ɗalapa Uɓeye a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi u ãwɔ Ɗa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ a ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛni.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ruu Ɗa Suru Au Tasi Shɔ Ɗa Vɔɔ Susãri abi a Kirisi kabii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />U dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa tɔ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi u ɓeye! Aru u yuɓasinɛ a Kirisini tasiu Ɗa vɔɔ susãritɛ bi a nyaba au ãu ko-pi ruu Ɗa Suru shɔpiya au tasiu shɔ Ɗa vɔɔ susãri bi a koo gbete a kolapayɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Koo u ɓɛɛ shɛnɛ, si Ɗalapa lɔu tɛttɔ gboti u ɔ̃ u ɓɛɛ, au yuɓasinɛ a Kirisini, aru u ɔ̃ shɔ Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ au ɗekɨn, shɔgbete ai ruuvini ɓa ɗɔnɓa.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:4">Aru u ɔrinɛ <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />Ɗalapa matɛttɔ au sisɨn nɛ a ka Yesɔ Kirisikɔ nɛn yɛ pɔ̃rɛ u ɔ̃ ɓɛɛ jaayi, <verse eid="EPH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />U bɛli Ɗalapa nɛ aru u tɔ̃vɨn bassinɛ, aru vi ãnɛ gbete ãuyɛ au ka jaa ɔrinɛyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Aru Kirisi kpaa gbete tɛ̃ɛ̃yɛ u kpaa naraanɛtɛ weze, Ɗalapa yaasiu ruuvinitɛ. a nyabakɔ Ɗalapa tasiunɛ u tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ pɛ pɛ̃niba, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />gbete au ãu bang dɔrɔrɔ yɛ!</para>
  <para style="p" vid="EPH 1:8">Au sẽrẽ a vigbete zɛyɛni piti kpai <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Ɗalapa pɔ̃rɛ nɛu zɛn ruugbete ma au sisɨnyɛtɔ, si pɔ̃ tɛttɔ nɛn yisi a ɓɛɛ jaa Kirisi kabii. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Ɗalapa ruugbete mayɛ tɔnɛn yɛ yisiunya a ɗagbete u ɗa kaanɛ, yɛ toli vigbete shɛhi a kolapa a kotipi ni kpai ɗɔgbete, Kirisikɔ yɛ ɔ̃rɛ i yupɛ̃ni.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Ko iviya shɔ pɛli jo nɔgbete Ɗalapa ma au sisɨn nɛn pɛliyɛkɔ; Ɗalapa lɔurɛ nɛu ɔ̃ n ɓɛshɔzɛ aka yuɓasinɛ a Kirisini, aru vigbete kasi pɛlinɛyɛ, ayuu vigbete ma au sisɨn aɗagbete gaa yɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Aru nankɔ u shɔgbete u gaa sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ a Kirisi bim, u bɛli Ɗalapa basinɛtɔ!<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Ɔkɔɔma ɔ ɔ̃ Ɗalapa ɓɛshɔbiiyitɛ naa ɔkɛ weshonɛ a ruu tɔ̃vɨn ni, ruu tɔ̃vɨn gbete au n-tiwɔ naranɛyɛ. Ɔ ã sisɨntɛ a Kirisi bi, a Ɗalapa pɔ̃ u naa vishonɛtɛ awɔ yuuni u tasinɛ ɔ pɛ nɓɛɛ a nyaba au ãwɔ Ɗa Suru gbete manɛn ãwɔyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Ɗa Suru ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ vigbete u yɛ kpaayɛ a Ɗalapa ma a ɓɛshɔbiiyini nyamasinɛ ɓa, vimkɔ tasiutɛ nɛ Ɗalapa yɛ ã shɔ gbete i ɔ̃ u ɓɛɛ ɔ̃nɛ yuutɔ kpai. U bɛli u bassinɛ nɛ!<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">N kpaa sisɨntɔ awɔ yuuni ang Ɗa Gakinɛni</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Aruumkɔ, n ntawɔ ruu sisɨn ãnɛ tɛttɔ tɛ̃ɛtɛ̃ɛ a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ biini awɔ zɔ ɔrinɛ gbete ɔ tasi Ɗalapa shɔbiiyini piti kpai, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />N ji yaa Ɗalapa dɔ̃rinɛ ɓa awɔ yuuni ɓa. N kpaasisɨntɔ awɔ yuuni nkɛ gaki Ɗanɛyɛ <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />n gaki Ɗalapa Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi, Uɓeye gbete u bassinɛ ɗɔn, u ãwɔ Ɗa Suru, shɔgbete yɛ pɔ̃rɛ ɔ ɔ̃ shɔ ruukpẽnɛ, u tasɔɔrɛ ɔ zɛ nyaba Ɗalapa tɔ, nɔgbete ɔ yɛ zɛuyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />N gaki rɛ aru ɔ sisɨn u ɓelitɔ ɔ zɛ ɗɔsẽsẽtɔ, nɔgbete ɔ zɛ vi sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ gbete ɓawɔnya au yuuniyɛ, n gaki Ɗa ɔ zɛ nɔgbete Ɗa tasiu shɔbiiyi susãri abi vinɔlusinɛ gbeteu ma a yinɛyɛ, <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />U shɔ gbeteu ãsisɨn au biini u kaka vishonɛ vibiizaanɛ yɛ ɔ̃ yisinɛ kɛpikoviya? Kaka gbete au shovi au tetem, pɛ zali a kaka pɛ̃nibamni <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />shomkɔ ɔ̃rɛ kaka gbete Ɗalapa shovi a wuniyɛ aɗagbete yusi Kirisi lapa a saa yɛ, a sɨurɛ nɛu ɔ̃ au ka nakɨn a koo gbete lapayɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Kirisikɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔgbete sã yupɛ̃ni kpai, yupɛ̃ni shɔ gbete a kolapayi a shɔ kotipiyini piti kpai a kpatiyi kakani kpai, Ɗalapa ãu niitɛ shɔ gbete tɛɛ nii gãsiyitɔ piti kpai a koom a gbete kaanɛyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Ɗalapa pɔ̃vi kpai aru Kirisi u naa dɔɔ ɗɔn a ãu shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn a Ɗa bi ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ Uɓeyelapa pɛ̃niba ayuu vi piti kpai. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii ikɔyi ɔ̃rɛ Kirisi bi, gbete yiitɛ a Kirisini, shɔ gbete yisinya vitɛ kpai kopiɗɔpiya.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yunɛ vɔrɔ anɛ Suru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Akɨnti ɔ si naa shɔ gbeteyi vɔtɛttɔyɛ aruviya ɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃ Ɗalapa nya gɨnnɛ awɔ pɛli ruuvini. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />A ɗauni ɔ gɨn nyaba kɔ̃linɛ shɔ kotipi; ɔ gɨn suru kɔ̃linɛ gbete i ɗaki shɔyɛ, suru gbete sã shɔgbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapa nyaɓayɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Nizɛ kɔ u kpai u sijo naa ikɔ, u gɨn jo vigbete u bi kasiyɛ, u pɛli vigbete u bi a sisɨn kasiyɛ. Au ɔ̃nɛ nɔgbete u kasiyɛ, jinagbete ko-piya kasiyɛ, ukɔma siu kãanɛ Ɗalapa sisɨn lɛsinɛ nɛu nɔ au yuu nagbete nɔ a shɔ zɔgãsiyi yuuyɛ.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Ama Ɗalapa raantanɛ pɛ bang, u ɔrinɛ gbete ɔriuyɛ pɛ̃niba, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />aruukɔ aɗagbete u si naa shɔgbeteyi vɔtɛttɔyɛ a suru u ji gɨn Ɗalapa nya ɓa, a sɔriu a suruni a Kirisi kabii. U kpaa naraanɛ a nyaba Ɗa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Au yuɓasinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔni, Ɗalapa yusiu laparɛ nɛu ɔ̃ awuni kolapa. <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />Ɗalapa pɛli vim aru u tasi shɔ laduru gbete i kaanɛ nɛ, u vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn au tɛɛ kaka shanɛtɔ aɗɔn yisinya ɓa, a ɔrinɛ gbete tasiu a Kirisi Yesɔ kabiiyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Aruiviya a nyaba Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ a sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabii ɔ kpaa naraanɛrɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Ɓa ruu ɔ vishonɛ kakabi ɓa, ama pɛ Ɗalapa vi ãnɛ, shɔwɔyɛ baasi ɓa au yuuni ɓa. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Ɗalapa kɔ pɔ̃u jo namini, au yuɓasinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔni, shɛshiu ayuu vitɔ̃vɨng pɛlinɛ, gbete pɔ̃siu tɛttɔ nɛu pɛliyɛ.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔ sisɨn Ãnɛ a Kirisi i Gbete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Ɔ shɔgbete ɔ ɓa Yahudawa ɓa a yeenɛ. Gbete Yahudawayi ɓainɛ &lt;&lt;shɔgbete shɔ ji yeeriyi shaa ɓayɛ&gt;&gt;ai ɓai yuunɛ shɔ yeeriyi shaatɛyɛ ( vim tasi vigbete vɔshɔ pɛliu biiyɛ ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ a nɔgbete ɔ si a kɨntiyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />A ɗauni si shɔ ji ɓasɔɔ ɓa Kirini ɓa. Ɔ si pɛ shɔzatiyi, awɔ si ɓa tete shɔgbete Ɗalapa lɔyiyɛni ɓa. Ɔ siɓa a tete ruumanɛni ɓa, gbete a Ɗalapa ma au shɔbiiyiyɛni ɓa, awɔ ɔ̃ a kotipim sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ ɓa, ɔ Ɗalapa ɓa. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Ama kayuɓasinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔni, shɔgbete ɔ si kpɛlɛ a wuniyɛ, a nyaba Kirisi kpaa Ɗalapa n-tɔɔtɛ maani awuni. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Aruviya Kirisi au yuu n-tiu ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛtɛ a nyaba gbete ɓasi Yahudawayi a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i ɔ̃tɛ gbete. Au bikɔ sãki kãsiri gbete vɔsiyirɛ a risiyi shɔnɔpɔ̃ a zɔni. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Sɔ̃ɔ̃ Musa nya-ãsinɛtɛ au nyadanɛni, pɛli vim ɗɔkɔ aru u ɓasi Yahudawayi a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa i ɔ̃ gbete awuni. A nyabankɔ i kpaa ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kirisi vɔnɛ a yulaa lɛsiyi ɔ̃nɛ nɔpɔ̃ kati; a nyaba laa gbete shɔ ɓaunaa aɗɔn ɓasi Yahudawayi a shɔgbete i ɓa Yahudawa ɓayi yuu gbete a sɔriyi a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Aruukɔ Kirisi arɛ a nwari ruu tɔ̃vɨn piti a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa kpai aru ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔnɛ, ɔ shɔgbete ɔ kpɛlɛ a Ɗalapani, a Yahudawayini shɔgbete i maani a Ɗalapani. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Ji a Kirisi ruubiikɔ u piti kpai, Yahudawayi a shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawa ɓa, u yɛ zɛnɔ anɛtɔ a Ɗalapa u Ɓeye ɗekɨn a suru gbete.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Aru nankɔ ɔ shɔgbete ɔ ɓa Yahudawa ɓam, ɔ tɔkɨn shɔtipi wɔɔyi ko shɔzatiyi ɓa; dɔdɔrim ɔ jatipiyi a Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi, ɔ tete Ɗalapa shɔwɛrɛyi. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Ɔkɔma shɔ maawɔtɛ jo a dɔjaa gbete Yesɔ jashonɛyi a janyagadi i gaa manɛyɛni, Kirisi Yesɔ au yuu ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ tari tɔ̃vɨn pɛ̃niba. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Ukɔ sã ɗɔmaanɛurɛ kpai a ɗɔzɔ, a pɔ̃ ɗɔu banɛrɛ ɔ̃ wɛrɛ Ɗa wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ gbete shɔ ã tɛtɔ a Uɓeyelapa naa. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Awɔ yuɓasinɛ a Kirisini ɔkɔma shɔ maawɔtɛ jo awuni nyazɔ, a shɔ gãsiyini kpai a ɗɔgbete Ɗalapa ɔ̃ yɛ, au ka suru.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Bulus Pɛli Shɔgbeteyi Ɓa Yahudawayi ɓa Vishonɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Aru gbetenkɔ, Nkɔng Bulus n ɔ̃ a jaahm aru Kirisi Yesɔ yuu n gaki Ɗa awɔ yuu shɔgbete ɔ ɓa Yahudawaɓayɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Pɛnizɛ ɔ ntatɛttɔ nɛ Ɗalapa aru u tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ ang vishonɛm nɛn pɛli awɔ yuu. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Ɗalapa ɓeli u ruumanɛ gbete ma a ɗɔɓusinɛ a tasinrɛ. ( N bee jaavi tɛttɔ au yuuni, <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />naa ɔkɛ ɓali vigbete n beeyɛnɛ, ɔ yɛ mativitɔ ang vigbete n zɛyɛni ayuu Kirisi viɓusinɛni.) <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Si tɛ̃ɛ̃tɛ̃ɛ Ɗalapa jo geli shɔ ruɓusinɛm ɓa, ama dɔdɔrim a nyaba Ɗa suru Ɗalapa ɓeli jashonɛ au janyagadiyi ruɓusinɛutɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Ruɓusinɛ ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ nɛ, a ka ruu tɔ̃vɨnkɔ Shɔgbeteyi ɓa Yahudawaɓa a Yahudawayini i kpaa Ɗa vɔɔ susãri tasinɛtɔ; i pɛ gboki bi gbetenkɔ, ikɔma i kpaa vitɔ atette vigbete Ɗalapa ma a Kirisi Yesɔ kabiini.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Ɗalapa pɔ̃ jawɛrɛ nɛn ayuu ruu tɔ̃vɨn aru sẽrẽ tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ gbete Ɗalapa ãng-yɛ, gbete ãng-yɛ au tete kaka vishonɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ pẽtẽrẽ a tete Ɗalapa ɓɛɛ shɔzɛyi ni; a shɔmni piti kpai Ɗalapa yaasin nyabatɛ nɛn n ti shɔ gbeteyi ɓa Yahudawayi ɓa ruu tɔ̃vɨn ɗɔrɔrɔm, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />Ɗalapa lɔrɛ n pɔ̃rɛ shɔ piti kpai shɔu zɛu ruɓusinɛ gbete ɓusi au sisɨn au vishonɛ. Ɗalapa shɔgbete au shɛshi vi piti kpai, ɓusi ruɓusinɛm gbiti-gbiti a saa gbete tɛɛyɛ piti kpai, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />Si a Ɗalapa sisɨn nɛ dɔdɔrim nɛn pɛli vishonɛ a shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn a Ɗabiiyɛ nɛi geli shɔ kakayi gbeteyi kolapa a kotipini i zɛ Ɗa ruu sẽrẽ tottot tɔ. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Ɗalapa pɛli vim ayuu u ruu gbete sɔ̃nyaɓayɛ, au kpaa pɛlinɛ a Kirisi Yesɔ Uɓeyelapa kabiiyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />A yuɓasinɛ a Kirisini au nyaba sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabi awuni u bilakitɛ u yɛ Ɗalapa ɗekɨn a kakani fɛ̃ɛm. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Aru nankɔ n gakɔɔtɔ ɔkɔɔ zɔ̃ sisɨnnɛ aruviya n ɗɔgbete n ɓooraa awɔ yuuyɛ; n pɛli vim piti kpai awɔ yuukɔ.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kirisi Ɔrinɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Aru vigbete Ɗalapa pɛlinyɛ n ta a yugboti au Ɓeye gbete a lapayɛ ɗekɨn, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ gbete ã wɛrɛ kopishɔpiya nii gaanɛrɛ a kolapa a kotipini kpai. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />N gaki Ɗalapa au tete ɓusɨng sisɨn bassinɛ waanɛ u ãwɔ kaka aka Ɗa suru aru ɔ sisɨn u lakitɔ, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />n gaki Ɗa n-tɛ Kirisi u kɔ u wɛrɛ awɔ sisɨn a nyaba sisɨn-ãnɛ. N gaki Ɗa n-tɛ ɔ kpaa gɨn-gɨn zɔ ɔrinɛtɔ, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />nɔgbete ɔ a shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn yɛ, ɔ kpaa kaka gbete ɔ zɛvi raaki fɛ̃ɛmtɔ, u yushinɛ au jambani, ukɔ Kirisi ɔrinɛ. <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />Ɔ a kati ɔ zɛu ɔrinɛrɛ ya ko a shomni kpai shɔ zɛ dɔɔɓa piti kpaini ɓa- aru nankɔ ɔ nta Ɗalapa vishonɛtɔ awɔ sisɨn.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Au bi u kaka vishonɛ aɗɔgbete shovi-shonɛ au biiyɛ, pɛli vishonɛtɛ fɛ̃ɛm tɛ vigbete au kãyɛtɔ, ko vigbete u yɛ lɛri a sisɨnyɛ: <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />bassinɛ yɛnɛ Ɗalapa bi a shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn Ɗabii a Kirisi Yesɔni ko-pi ɗaviya, yunɛ dɔdɔrim yɛnɛ ɗekɨn dangdang! Nankɔ.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s1">Shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ i Gbete a Kirisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />N gakɔɔtɔ n shɔgbete n a jaahm aru gbete n gɨn Uɓeyelapayɛ: n masɔɔ bi ɔ pɛli ji tɔ̃vɨn naa shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ Ɗabiiyi pɛliyɛ nɔgbete Ɗalapa shayɛ kɛ ɓawɔ nyanɛyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Ko-pi ɗaviya, ɔ ɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi ɗeyuu ɓa, shɔgbeteyi laki yuu ɓa, shɔgbeteyi mɛɛsisɨntɔyɛ. Ɔ tasi zɔ ɔrinɛtɔ a zɔ ɓasinɛni. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Ɔ mabiitɔ fɛ̃ɛm ɔ sã yuɓasinɛ gbete Ɗa suru ãwɔtɔ a nyaba ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ a kopiyani. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Bi ji gbete Ɗa suru sɔ̃n ji gbete, ji nankɔ sisɨn pɔ̃nɛ ji gbete a Ɗalapa ɓawɔ nya a yuuniyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Uɓeyelapa ji gbete, sisɨn ãnɛ gbete, batizima sɔ̃nji gbete; <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />Ɗalapa ji gbete, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ shɔ Ɓeye piti kpai, ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Uɓeyelapa kpai, shovi a shɔ yuu piti kpai, u a shɔsisɨn piti kpai.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Ama ko-piya Kirisi ãu vi-ãnɛ tɛttɔ totot nɔgbete i pɛliu vishonɛyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 4:8">&lt;&lt;Aɗagbete gẽ lapa feefee ye,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">tu shɔgbete sãyi yɛ a naani;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 4:8">a ã shɔ vi-ãnɛyitɔ.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Dɔdɔrim &lt;&lt;u yɛnɛ lapau&gt;&gt; tasi kɛnɛ iviya? tasinɛ au gaanɛ noo arɛ a tɔ̃ɔ̃ tipidii. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Shɔgbete au noo arɛ lapa sɔ̃n dijo ukɔ gẽ laparɛ, a koo gbete tɛɛ kolapayi yɛ, aruviya u yisi kolapa a kotipini piti kpai au ɔ̃nɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Si Kirisikɔ ã &lt;&lt;shɔ vi-ãnɛrɛ&gt;&gt;; Yesɔ lɔ zɔ gãsiyi nɛ ɔ̃ jashonɛyi, shɔwɔyi nɛi ɔ̃ janyagadi, shɔwɔyi nɛi ɔ̃ shɔgbete i gɔ̃ shɔ nɛi rii kirisayɛ, shɔwɔyi nɛi ɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi nwari shɔ Ɗanyaruubii a shɔmalayi. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Yesɔ Pɛli vim piti kpai aru masi shɔ Ɗalapa gɨnnɛyi bi i pɛli shɔ sisɨn ãnɛyi vishonɛ. Nɗa shɔ Ɗalapa gɨnnɛyi kpai i ɔ̃ a kakani ai sisɨn ãnɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Aru nankɔ u piti kpai u ɓasi yuu a ɗɔzɔɔ u ɔ̃ gbete a yɛti sisɨn ãnɛ, au ruu zɛnɛ aru Ɗa jaa; u ɔ̃ shɔgbeteyi batɛtɔyɛ, u kpaa nya aɗɔgbete Kirisi banɛ doonyayɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Kɛɗɔn u ɔ̃ tɔkɨn naa jabẽrẽti ɓa, naa sɔrɔ kɛ shɛnɛ u tuurɛ u gisiurɛ a nyaba gbete shɔ-shɔɗakinɛyi mati shɔyɛ, shɔgbeteyi i ɗashɔ ai sẽrẽniyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Ama ukɛ sha vitɔ̃vɨng nɛ a suru zɔ ɔrinɛ, ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u ba a Kirisini shɔ gbete ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ yupɛ̃ni. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />A Yesɔ nakɔ ko-pi gboki bi gbete piya ukɔ sãrɛ a baasiyi a ɗɔzɔ, bi gbete shɔ sãu gbokiyi a ritiyi a ɗɔzɔɔ nɔgbete shɔ pɛliyiyɛ. Naa ko-pi gboki gbetepiya kɛ shovinɛ nagbete shoyɛ, biwu piti kpai barɛ a ma yuu a ka ɔrinɛ.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Suru Sɔɔ a Kirisi a Bi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Kɛɗɔn a Kirisi nii n gɔ̃wɔ yusho: ɔkɔ ɔ̃nɛ naa shɔgbeteyi gɨn Ɗalapa ɓayɛ toti, shɔgbete i lɛri a yuuvi waati <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />shɔgbete i sisɨn a ɗɔkɨnri. i yɛ kpaa suru gbete Ɗalapa ã shɔyɛ ɓa, i sisɨn piti kpai yɛ zɛ viɓa ai ruu yulakinɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />I sisɨn yusẽe ntanɛ ɓa ko fẽe; i ã yuutɛ a ko-pi vikɔ̃linɛ gbetepiya pɛlinɛ, i pɛli vikɔ̃linɛ gbɔgbɔ, naa kpangtang, i bɛ̃ɛ yaanɛtɔ.<verse eid="EPH 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />N ɓa vigbete ɔ mati a Kirisi yuuyɛ ɓa! <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />N zɛ tɛttɔ shɔ gelɔɔ u ruubiitɛ, ji nagbete ɔ siu jadɔɔ shɔ matiwɔɔ tɔ̃vɨn gbete a Yesɔ yuuyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Aruukɔ ɔ yawɔ nyaba gbaali kati, gbete pɔ̃ɔrɛ ɔ ɔ̃ nagbete ɔ ɔ̃ siyɛ, au vishɔ ɗakinɛ lɛsi tɛttɔyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ, ɔ sisɨn a lɛrinɛni ɔ kɔsitɔ u ɔ̃ sɔɔ kpai, <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng awɔ kɔrɔ ɔ tuu sisɨn sɔɔ, gbete Ɗalapa shɛshi au shẽbiiyɛ naa u ɓɛɛyɛ, a tasiu yuu a shonɛ tɔ̃vɨn a ɔ̃nɛ Wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Nyayelinɛ tɔɓa, kɛɗɔn ko-piya ɔ̃riutɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ u geli shɔgbete i ã sisɨn Ɗabii ruu nizɛ tɔ, aruviya u ji gboki bikɔ Kirisi bi kpai. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Naa ɔ sisɨn kɛ lɛsinɛ, ɔkɔɔ yawɔ sisɨn lɛsinɛ nɛ u n-tɔɔ ruuvinirɛ, ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ ɗau yisɔɔrɛ a sisɨn lɛsinɛni. <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />Ɔkɔɔ yaasi japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ nyabanɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Akɛ ɔ̃nɛ shɔ ɓɔɔ ɓɔnɛ, ɔ̃raatɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ a yaa kati a gaa vishonɛ pɛlinɛ, aru a kpaa vigbete ɔ̃ a yuu tɔ̃vɨn, nɔgbete a yɛ pɔ̃si shɔraayi naa joyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Ɔkɔɔ shɛshi ruukɔ̃linɛ nɛ awɔ nyani, ama ɔ shɛshi jo ruu tɔ̃vɨn. Ruugbete masi shɔbii a vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn gbete yɛ ãwɔ vigbete ɔ kasiyɛ, nɔgbete ɔ kɛ shanɛ u ɔ̃ ji vitɔ̃vɨng a shɔgbete i wesho awɔ nyayɛ. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Ama ɔkɔɔ lɛsi Ɗa Suru sisɨnnɛ; aruviya Ɗa suru ukɔ ɔ̃rɛ Ɗalapa vitasinɛ awɔ yuuni, lewu yɛ atɔ nyamasinɛ ɓa gbete Ɗalapa yɛ yawɔ naa. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Ɔ yaa gãgãshaanɛ kati, sisɨn kɔnɛ, a sisɨn lɛsinɛni. Marinɛ ko zɔ dãnɛ tɔkɨn ɓa, ɔkɔɔ bɛ̃ɛ̃ zɔnɛ tɔkɨn. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Anɔgbete ɔ pɛli nankɔ ɔ pɛli zɔ vitɔ̃vɨngtɔ, ɔ yaasi zɔ ruuvinitɔ nagbete Ɗalapa yasɔɔ ruuvini a Kirisi kabiiyɛ.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔ̃nɛ a Ɗɔsẽsẽ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Ji nagbete ɔ pɛ Ɗalapa jaa ɔrinɛ, ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ɔ ɔ̃ ji naa ukɔ. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ɔrinɛ u sãwɔrɛ, ji nagbete Kirisi ɔriuyɛ ãu suru au yuu, naa vinaa ãnɛ sũru-sũru a viyuu ãnɛ gbete Ɗalapa nta tɔ̃vɨntɔ a wuniyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Ji nagbete ɔ pɛ Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi, ji kɔri ɓa ruu kpantanɛ ko ruu vikɔ̃linɛ ko yuukasinɛ shɔ ɓanɛ ɔ a wuni ɓa. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Ji ɗɔkɔ a ruu kɔ̃linɛ nwanɛ, a ruu gbete yɛ n ti Ɗalapa bassinɛ ɓa, a rãng pɛlinɛni, ji kɔri ɓa shɔ ɓanɛ ɔ awuni ɓa, nɔgbete ɔ si pɛli nam ɔ dɔ̃ri ɓɛɛ ji Ɗalapa. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Ɔ zɛtɔ nɛ shɔ kpantang pɛlinɛ, shɔ vikɔ̃linɛ pɛlinɛ ko shɔ yuu kasinɛ, ( aru shɔ yuu kasinɛ u a shɔgbete gɨn jaɗa ni zali.) yɛ kpaa viwɔɔ ɓa a Kirisi kpati roonɛ a Ɗalapa ɓɛɛni ɓa. <verse eid="EPH 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Ɔkɔɔ yaa shɔwɔnɛ u ɗakɔɔrɛ a ruu kɔ̃linɛni; jo aru vigbetemiyikɔ Ɗalapa sisɨn lɛsinɛ yɛ no a shɔgbete i gɨu nyaɓayɛ i yuu. <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />Aru nankɔ viwɔkɔ ɓasɔnɛ a shɔmiyini. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Siwɔ ɔ̃ pɛ a ɗɔkɨnri, dɔdɔrim ɔ ɔ̃ kɛtɛ Uɓeyelapa shɔbiiyi, ɔ a ɗɔsẽsẽ. Aru nankɔ ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng a kɔrɔ ɔ ɔ̃ naa shɔ ɗɔsẽsẽyi, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />aru ɗɔsẽsẽkɔ n ti vitɔ̃vɨng jo, tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛ a ruu nizɛni. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Ɔ mabiitɔ ɔ mati vigbete Uɓeyelapa kasiyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Ɔkɔɔ pɛli vi kotipimnɛ naa shɔwɔyi pɛliyɛ, vigbete shɔ pɛli a ɗɔkɨnriyɛ anɔgbete ɔ si pɛli nam ɔ shɛshi a ɗɔsẽsẽ. ( <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Pɛ kpẽnti viyusẽẽ shɔ sha vigbete i pɛli aɗɔ ɓuzɨnɛyɛ.) <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Naa shɔkɛ shɛshi vimiyinɛ piti kpai a ɗɔsẽsẽ, kɛɗɔn shɔyɛ zɛ viu kɛ wasa-wasa nɔgbete i ɔ̃ yɛ; <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />aru ko-iviya gbete shɔkɛ shɛshinɛyɛ rikɛ ɗɔsẽsẽ. Aru gbetenkɔ shɔ shanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">&lt;&lt;Shɔgbete aɗɔ nɔrɔ roonɛm yulapanɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="EPH 5:14">yulapanɛ a vɔrɔni,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="EPH 5:14">Kirisi yɛ kɔlitɔ aa biini.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />N gelɔɔtɛ ɔ kɔyuutɔ awɔ ɔ̃nɛni. Ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ a shɔgbeteyi rãng-yini, ama ɔ ɔ̃ jo naa shɔruukpẽnɛyi. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Ɔ pɛli vishonɛ a ɗagbete ɔ kpaayɛni tɔ̃vɨn, aruviya dii mi pɛ dii kɔ̃linɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Ɔkɔɔ ɔ̃nɛ rãng-yi, ama ɔ mabii ɔ kã jo vigbete Uɓeyelapa kasinɛ ɔ pɛliyɛ<verse eid="EPH 5:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Ɔkɔɔ ɓoo mii inabinɛ u tɛwɔ kakarɛ, au yɛ lɛsɔɔyɛnɛ; Ama ɔ yaa Ɗa suru u rauwɔ birɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Ɔ nwari zɔ nya a ruu Zabura, ɔ tɔ̃ɔ̃ soo beelinɛ a soo wɔsɔ-wɔsɔyini; ɔ tɔ̃ri Uɓeyelapa soo ɓeline a Zaburani a ɓelinɛni awɔ sisɨn. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />A Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi nii, ɔ dɔ̃ri Ɗalapa u Ɓeye ko-pi leepiya ayuu vi piti kpai.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Shɔwɛrɛyi a Suwɛrɛyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Ɔ ã yuu a zɔbii ɔ pɛli nankɔ a Kirisi setintanɛni <verse eid="EPH 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Suwɛrɛyi ɔ ã yuu a mɛvɔyiyi bi naa ɔ ã Uɓeyelapayɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Aruviya vɔshɔ u kaka a ɓɛso yuuni, jo nagbete Kirisi u kaka a shɔ Ɗa gɨnnɛyi biiyɛ; Kirisi au yuu ukɔ ɔ̃ jo shɔgbete ã sisɨn a Ɗabii i shɔ-shɔraanɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Ji ɗɔkɔ suwɛrɛyi ɔ ã yuu a mɛvɔyi bi kpai ji nagbete shɔ sisɨn ãnɛ a Ɗabiiyi i ã yuu a Kirisi biiyɛ.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Ɔ Shɔwɛrɛyi ɔ ɔri mɛsoyitɔ ji nagbete Kirisi ɔri shɔ gbeteyi ã sisɨn a Ɗabiiyɛ a ãu suru ai yuuni. <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />Pɛli vim aru gbete kasinɛn pɔ̃rɛ nɛu ɔ̃ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ a Ɗalapa ɗɔbii, a nyaba u nyanwanɛ a knti gbete sɔki a mii tɛpɛ-tɛpɛyɛ, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />pɛli vim a ɗagbete ã shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn Ɗabii i yuu, aru i kɔritɔ tɛpɛ-tɛpɛ, ruuvini ɓa, i ɔ̃ wɔsɔ-wɔsɔ ko shɔ ɓau nii ɓa a vikɔ̃linɛni ɓa. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Shɔwɛrɛyi ɔ ɔri mɛsoyitɔ ji nagbete ɔ ɔrɔɔ biiyɛ. shɔwɛrɛ gbete kɛ ɔri ɓesonɛ ɔri jo u yuu. ( <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Shɔwɔ jo bɛ̃ɛ̃ u bi ɓa legbeteni ɓa. Anɔgbete u si pɛli nam u shaari biyitɔ, u kɔyirɛ, ji nagbete Kirisi pɛli a shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn Ɗabiiniyɛ; <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />Aru u pɛ jo u gboki bikɔ.) <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />Nagbete Ɗanyaruubii shayɛ nɛ,&lt;&lt;Aru gbetenkɔ vɔshɔ yɛ yaa u ɓeye a ɓinini u rɛɛ zɔ a ɓeso, i zitimiyi i yɛ ɔ̃kɛ gbete.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Shɔmpɛ ruuɓusinɛ gbikiri-gbikiri gbete shɔ ɓeli a Ɗanyaruubiiyɛ, gbete ang zɛrɛ shɔ sha a Kirisi yuu a shɔ gbeteyi ãsisɨn a Ɗabiiyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Ama ruum ɗiwɔ naatɛ jo a biini: ɔ̃rɔɔtɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ko-pi shɔwɛrɛ gbetepiya u ɔri ɓesotɔ naa u yuu, ɔ̃tɛ kaka jazɨng akɔrɔ ko-pi so shɔpiya u bassi ɓɛvɔtɔ.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s1">Jaayi, ɓeye a ɓini</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Jaayi, pɛ ɔ vishonɛ Kirisakɔ ɔ gɨn ɔ meye a miniyi nyatɔ, aru shɔmkɔ ɔ̃rɛ vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn gbete ɔ pɛliyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />&lt;&lt;Ɔ bassi ɔ meye a miniyitɔ&gt;&gt; n pɛ nya-ãsinɛ gaanɛ gbete shɔ marɛ a pɔ̃ viwɔ ɗɔnyɛ: <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />&lt;&lt;Nɔgbete a yɛ kpaa ɔ̃nɛ tɔ̃vɨn, nɗa a kpaa ɔ̃nɛ dɔkɔkɔ a koo.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Jaɓeyeyi ɔkɔɔ sɨn mɛjaayinɛ i yɛti lɛsirɛ. Ama ɔ basiyirɛ ɔ gɔ̃yi sho a nyaba kirisa a ruugelinɛni.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Fooyi a Shɔwɛrɛyi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Fooyi ɔ gɨn ɔ shɔwɛrɛyi nyatɔ gbeteyi a kotipim ɔ basiyitɔ fɛ̃ɛm; ɔ pɛli a sisɨn gbete, nagbete ɔ pɛli Kirisiyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Ɔkɔɔ pɛlinɛ aɗagbete shɔ nɔɔ awɔ bikɔ sheeli ɓa, naa shɔgbeteyi kã bɛlinɛyɛ; ama ɔ pɛli jo vigbete Ɗalapa kasiyɛ a sisɨn gbete, naa Kirisi fooyi. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Ɔ pɛlɔɔ vishonɛ a sisɨn puru, naa foo shoshi Uɓeyelapayɛ, ɓa naa ɔ shoshi shɔzɛyi ɓa. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ nɛ Uɓeyelapa yɛ ã ko-piya viɗɔnwanɛtɔ, ko foo ko jawɛrɛ, aru vishonɛ tɔ̃vɨn gbete pɛliyɛni. <verse eid="EPH 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Ɔ shɔwɛrɛyi ɔ pɛlijo ɗɔkɔ awɔ fooyi ni ɔkɔɔ zatiyinɛ. Ɔ kpaa sisɨntɔ awɔ fooyi ni ɔ shɔwɛrɛ gbete a kolapa, shɔgbete au yeeri kopiya ruu zali au tasi yuu vɔsi ɓa.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɗalapa Fãrã bawaanɛ</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />A kɨntiuni kpai, ɔ masi zɔ bitɔ ɔ ɓasinɛ yuu a Uɓeyelapa kaka vishonɛ pẽnɛba. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Ɔ hã fãrã au Ɗalapa ãwɔyɛ gbete yɛ rawɔ a sɨnyɛ a bi piti kpai, nɔgbete ɔ zɛnɔɔ shinɛ a japɛ̃pɛ̃ɛ̃ nyaba shɔɗanɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Aruviya u waaba ɓa a shɔzɛ ɓa ama u waaba a suru kɔ̃linɛ gbeteyi a kotipiyɛ , a kpatiyi, kaka vishonɛyi, a shɔgbete ai sã kpati ɗɔkɨnri jakɨntimiyi ai naa. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Aru nankɔ ɔ tosi visɨntanɛ gbete Ɗalapa ãwɔyɛ dɔdɔrim! naa dii kɔ̃linɛu kaanɛ ɔ zɛnɔɔ shinɛtɔ a sisɨnmanɛni; a knti gbete ɔkɛ waabaunɛyɛ kɛɗɔn ɔ rawɔ tipirɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Aru nankɔ ɔ mabiitɔ, a tɔ̃vɨn u ɔ̃ naa rii gbete ɔ ma awɔ sãnyɛ, tɔ̃vɨn pɛlinɛni u ɔ̃kɛ ɔ fãrã sɨntanɛ, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />ɔ bimanɛ u ɔ̃ naa kodɔɔ gbete n ti ruu tɔ̃vɨn ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Ko-pi ɗaviya ɔ tuu sisɨn ãnɛ u ɔ̃ naa vigbete yɛ rawɔyɛ ɔ nyo yaa shɔ shɔ-shɔlinɛm awuni. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Ɔ tɛ wayuu lasaka naa viyuu raanɛ, ɔ tuu ruu Ɗalapa naa shala gbete suru ãwɔyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Ɔ gaki Ɗa kopiɗaviya a nyaba Ɗa suru naapɔ̃nɛ, Aruumkɔ ɔ ɔ̃ a nɔkãkãri, ɔ bi ukɔ vɔnɛ; ɔ gaki Ɗalapa shɔbiiyi Ɗatɔ ko-pileepiya. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Ɔ gaking Ɗa sɔ̃njo nɛ Ɗalapa u ang ruu a nya n kɛ mabiinɛ ntɔ n nwanyayɛ, nɔgbete n nwanya a kakani n tasi shɔ vigbete shɔ ɓusi a ruu tɔ̃vɨnyɛ. <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />Aruviya jo ruu tɔ̃vɨnkɔ nkɔng ɔ̃rɛ Kirisi janɔɔ, ko dɔdɔrim n a jaahmi. Ɔ gaking Ɗa n kpaa kaka nyanwanɛtɔ aru ruu tɔ̃vɨn naa n si pɛliyɛ.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nyageenɛ Dangdang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />U ɓɛzɔ̃ shɔ ɔrinɛ Taishiku Kirisi jashonɛ, shɔgbete au shoshiu Uɓeyelapa vishoshinɛ sisɨn gbete, ukɔ yɛ gelɔɔ n ruubiirɛ piti kpai, nɔgbete n ɔ̃ yɛ a vigbete n a ɓuzɨnyɛni. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Jo ruukɔ n shou awɔ ɗɔbii u gelɔɔ vigbete u a ɓuzɨniyɛ kpai wɔsɔ̃n u masɔɔbiitɔ. <verse eid="EPH 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />N shɔbiiyi, Ɗalapa u Ɓeye a Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi u ãu Kirisayi ɔ̃nɛbiinyatɔ̃nɛ, ɔrinɛ a sisɨn ãnɛni piti kpai. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Ɗalapa tɔ̃vɨn shonɛ u ɔ̃ a shɔgbeteyi ɔri Uɓeyelapa Yesɔ Kirisi a ɔrinɛ gbete sɔ̃nyaɓayɛni.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>